[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0010","text":"怎么样，穿着感觉如何？\n有没有不方便活动的地方？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0020","text":"嗯……\n还……不太习惯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0030","text":"哈哈，嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0040","text":"那就多穿几次，\n直到习惯为止吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0050","text":"明白了……\n那么……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0060","text":"今日……十次……\n明日……十次……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0070","text":"十日之后……\n一百次……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0080","text":"哈哈哈，你要穿那么多次吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0090","text":"不过……\n没关系的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0100","text":"慢慢来就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200100_02_0004","text":"Motion"}]
